    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "A geometric series has a limiting sum of 5 and first term 3. Find the common ratio.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$r=\\frac{2}{5}$",
      "worked": "$S_\\infty=5,\\ a=3$\n$$\\begin{align*}S_\\infty&=\\frac{a}{1-r}\\\\5&=\\frac{3}{1-r}\\\\5-5r&=3\\\\2&=5r\\\\r&=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{align*}$$",
